---
title: Cauliflower Cheese
description: Classic north-European winter main or side
servings: 4
source: https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/wordofmouth/2012/nov/15/how-cook-perfect-cauliflower-cheese
author: Felicity Cloake
image: https://i.guim.co.uk/img/static/sys-images/Guardian/Pix/pictures/2012/11/14/1352892679373/Felicitys-perfect-caulifl-006.jpg?width=620&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none
course: Side
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
prep time: 30m
cook time: 1h
cuisine: British
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- savoury
